## Important Notes:

### FAQ Class Names
- Use `.faq1`, `.faq2`, `.faq3`, `.faq4`, `.faq5` for the outer wrapper
- These provide the card border styling

### Answer IDs
- Each answer needs a unique ID: `answer1`, `answer2`, `answer3`, etc.
- Make sure the `onclick="toggleAnswer('answer1')"` matches the `id="answer1"`

### Adding More FAQs
- Increment the class number: `.faq4`, `.faq5`, etc.
- Increment the answer ID: `answer4`, `answer5`, etc.
- Keep the script at the bottom (only needs to be included once per page)

### Icon Image
- Always use: `https://www.bobjohnson.com/product_images/uploaded_images/favicon.png`
- Width and height set to 15x15

### The Only Difference
- **Button format**: `<button class="expandfaq button-alt" onclick="...">`
- **Div format**: `<div class="expandfaq" onclick="...">`
- Everything else is identical!

